        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "b48f7ebd-137e-5eb5-b2e7-db4fd63ab907",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Phil LaMarr\n- Television Series: MADtv, Justice League, Justice League Unlimited, Futurama, Samurai Jack, Static Shock, Foster's Home for Imaginary Friends\n- Video Game Series and Games: Jak and Daxter, Darksiders, Final Fantasy XII, inFAMOUS, Dead Island\n- Organizations and Concepts: DC Comics, Justice League superhero team\n\nFacts:\n- Phil LaMarr was one of the original cast members on the sketch comedy series MADtv.\n- Phil LaMarr had major voice acting roles in the animated series Justice League, Justice League Unlimited, Futurama, Samurai Jack, Static Shock, and Foster's Home for Imaginary Friends.\n- Phil LaMarr also provided voices for video games including the Jak and Daxter series, Darksiders, Final Fantasy XII, inFAMOUS, and Dead Island.\n- Justice League Unlimited features a wide array of superheroes from the DC Comics universe.\n- Justice League Unlimited is specifically based on the Justice League superhero team.\n- Justice League Unlimited is a direct sequel to the animated series Justice League.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "92d6423a-2b0e-5192-9a96-aaad9d2b22e2",
        "text": "Page: Phil LaMarr. Sentence: He was one of the original cast members on the sketch comedy series \"MADtv\", and has had an extensive voice acting career, with major roles spanning animated series \"Justice League\"/\"Justice League Unlimited\", \"Futurama\", \"Samurai Jack\", \"Static Shock\", and \"Foster's Home for Imaginary Friends\".\nPage: Phil LaMarr. Sentence: He has also done voices for video games such as \"\" and \"\", \"\", the \"Jak and Daxter\" series, \"Darksiders\", \"Final Fantasy XII\", \"inFAMOUS\", and \"Dead Island\".\nPage: Justice League Unlimited. Sentence: Featuring a wide array of superheroes from the DC Comics universe, and specifically based on the Justice League superhero team, it is a direct sequel to the previous \"Justice League\" animated series.",
        "type": "DocumentChunk"
      },
